      "purposeInStoryline": "Lessons 1-7 showed that organisms are adapted to habitats and that populations depend on biotic and abiotic factors. Lesson 8 supplies the missing mechanism for the extra algae, weeds and smell in the river: nutrients cycle between living things and the environment, and human activity can overload them. It ends with the new question: Does pollution affect organisms?",
