        "teacherMoves": "Say: 'Which questions on our board can we now answer? Move them to the Answered column and show the evidence.' Ask: 'What new questions has today raised?' WAIT TIME 10-15 seconds. Cold-call 4 learners to place and read a question. Highlight a question about pollution and organisms and say: 'Our cycles show nutrients can be overloaded. Does pollution affect organisms? That is our next lesson.' Ensure question wording is clear and testable.",
        "sensemakingStrategy": "Driving Question Board tracking: sorting answered and unanswered questions shows learners their growing understanding and builds ownership of the investigation sequence.",
