        "teacherMoves": "Say: 'Our model from Lesson 7 showed factors affecting populations. What must we add today?' Invite 3 learners to add components to the class model and explain the arrows. Cold-call 3 more to state one thing in the model that has changed since Lesson 1. Use WAIT TIME 10-15 seconds. Ask: 'What does our model still not explain?' (e.g. toxic chemicals, plastic, heat). Close with: 'We have explained the algae and smell. But does pollution affect organisms in other ways? Keep that question for our next lesson.' Remind learners to reuse materials and tidy up.",
