    "teacherReflection": "Did learners correctly place arrows and processes in both cycles, or did they confuse nitrification and denitrification? Which groups linked nutrient enrichment to oxygen depletion and not just to 'more algae'? Was the peer review feedback specific and useful? How well did learners use Kenyan examples such as Rhizobium in beans, farms near Kericho and runoff into Lake Victoria? What adjustments are needed to wait time, grouping, or resources before Lesson 9 on the effects of pollution?",
