      "attitudes": "Citizenship: solves problems in the local community by making posters to sensitise the community about the effects of environmental pollution. Self-efficacy: communicates clearly with others while discussing the causes and impacts of pollution and climate change. Integrity: utilises resources prudently. Patriotism: demonstrates love for the country while sensitising the community about the effects of environmental pollution. Waste Management PCI: appreciates the importance of proper waste management. Prevention of Global Warming PCI: appreciates the need to reduce greenhouse gas emissions.",
